{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415482","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415482","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041548201:1":{"text":"よお、兄ちゃん！","source_cn":"嘿，小伙子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D606C63EF9195E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041548202:1":{"text":"未知のシグナル、警戒。","source_cn":"陌生信号，警戒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6049C652944DE810","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041548203:1":{"text":"まあまあ、そう緊張すんな。ワシはお前さんをじっくり調べたいだけだ。","source_cn":"小伙子，别那么紧张。我只是想好好研究研究你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DC0F1179F9C2D8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041548204:1":{"text":"なんとまあ精巧に作られた機械構造だ！歯車、鎖……よほっ！はめ込まれた目ん玉まで寸分の狂いもない！","source_cn":"你身上的机巧十分精致！瞧瞧，齿轮、锁链……嚯嚯，就连你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4138BE43FDFF878","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041548205:1":{"text":"お前さんを作ったのはきっとワシの同胞に違いない。そいつの名前を覚えてるか？","source_cn":"制作你的人肯定是我的同胞，这准没错，你还记得制作你的人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ACB38AB441CCCD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041548206:1":{"text":"……機体の名は、ゴーラン。","source_cn":"……本机体，铐兰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5495E698D7E2C7FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041548207:1":{"text":"それはお前さんの名前だろう。同じ事を繰り返し言うだけじゃ話が進まないぞ。","source_cn":"噢，我当然知道你的名字，小伙子。光重复这些没意义。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F9A83495EF3C0C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041548208:1":{"text":"できればお前さんを分解して、内部構造をとことん調べてみたいものだな。ワシなら、人間そっくりな機械人形を作れる自信があるぞ！","source_cn":"真想再把你拆开研究研究，只要再仔细观察一次你的内部构造...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DF21EECBA537B15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041548209:1":{"text":"作る、禁止。これ以上、苦痛を……生み出してはならない。","source_cn":"再造，禁止。痛苦……不能延续。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C67FDA601EEFA67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041548210:1":{"text":"――断固阻止！","source_cn":"——阻止！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30267C133593F359","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041548211:1":{"text":"よほっ！怒るなって！お前さんをもう一体作るとは言ってないだろう。","source_cn":"嚯，嚯，别生气！我不是说要再造一个你……","st